    "summary": "Kobe Beef Steak Mouriya Gion offers a classy teppanyaki experience focused on high-quality Kobe beef. While some found the experience basic for the price, others raved about the exceptional customer service, atmosphere, and the melt-in-your-mouth A5 Kobe beef sirloin, deeming it one of the best steaks they've ever had."
