    "summary": "Gyukatsu Kyoto Katsugyu serves delicious and reasonably priced beef sets in a comfortable, upmarket atmosphere. Customers love the tender, medium-rare beef that can be further cooked on a personal ceramic stove, complemented by friendly and efficient English-speaking staff."
