    "summary": "Honolu Grande Kyoto Halal Restaurant offers a unique halal ramen experience with a spicy chicken-based broth, though experiences can vary. While some appreciate the flavorful ramen and the availability of a prayer room, others have noted issues with the service and strict ordering policies."
